            # fitting hulls, and at the default resolution the voxel edge on this
            # drawer is ~4.5 mm (0.447 x 0.518 x 0.197 m), so the front face comes
            # out in ~4.5 mm steps. A fingertip resting on it and sweeping open
            # climbs one and jams. shrinkWrap projects the hull points back onto the
            # source mesh, which is what flattens the face again; the finer voxels
            # are cheap here because the mesh is 120 triangles.
